  "sourceTitle": "Moist Banana Bread",
  "sourceText": "Moist Banana Bread\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, December 16, 2009 - 11:35pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 1/4 cups flour\n1 cup sugar\n1/2 teaspoon salt\n1 teaspoon soda\n1/2 cup shortening\n2 sm. bananas or 1 c. puree\n2 eggs, well beaten\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix dry ingredients and shortening. Puree bananas and add to flour mixture. Add well beaten eggs. Bake in greased loaf pan at 350 degrees for 40 to 45 minutes or until done. Nuts can be added.",
